 ["2,652 ms end-to-end still sits against Neo4j embedded's 246 ms for the same query on the same data (2026-08-01-ldbc-snb-interactive.edn). The gap narrowed; it did not close."
  "Still index-nested-loop. hasCreator is 7,355 rows total -- one scan plus a hash join beats thousands of seeks, and datalog-query-plan already computes the :estimated-rows needed to choose between them. Threading that hint into the executor is the next change."
